      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also, it seems steps were intentionally taken by VRChat to make sure that this doesn't happen to walk animations. The walk animations are only played locally and not remotely. I'm assuming this problem also popped up on walking animations, but it was fixed because it was more noticeable.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
